{"id":"vod_sn_36554","vodId":"36554","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"七色星露","name_cn":"七色星露","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a37359bd44abcdc3c3d43ee6aea2fb47.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在每晚都能够看到流星的城市——星之丘。长久以来，自幼生活在那里的少年石蕗正晴（野岛裕史 配音）都为自己内向而羞涩的个性所苦恼，因为这性格，正晴甚至都无法交到任何的朋友，于是，改变自己并且交到朋友，这成为了正晴目前最大的目标。　　一次偶然中，正晴喝下了魔法果汁，并且因此而获得了在夜间变成可爱小绵羊的超能力！抓狂的正晴被告知，只有收集所谓的“星之露”，才能够让他恢复正常，而唯有某个拥有特殊魔法的少女才有收集星之露的能力。让正晴感到震惊的是，那个魔法少女不是别人，正是他一直暗恋着的女孩秋姬素桃（结本满 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/ZMQZEiduZQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/LMHaAEcfWH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/MFHu6SHHJF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/MHNf2wM1Qs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/ycxvQhCER81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/zeT1RcXNRf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/JRXx7TWLSC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Aw3hZNk5rC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/E96G1xqtYe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/DQzENn66Zf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/Vn8ZXcbU4c1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.193Z"}